android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/captures/
android/.externalNativeBuild/
android/app/release/
android/app/debug/

# iOS native project (Capacitor) - source is tracked; only local/build/generated state is ignored
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/output/
ios/App/App/public/
ios/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
ios/App/App/capacitor.config.json
ios/App/App/config.xml
ios/App/CapApp-SPM/symlinks/
ios/App/CapApp-SPM/.build/
ios/App/CapApp-SPM/.swiftpm/
ios/capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins/

